        "conf": "read"
      },
      {
        "title": "Run at Campbell and Young",
        "detail": "Lindstrom is +7.1 on Calais Campbell and Taylor is +5 on Zion Young (FMV 68). Duo and stretch to the right keep Madubuike away from Bergeron (-5.8) and keep us on schedule.",
        "conf": "read"
      },
      {
        "title": "Take away Andrews, not the outside WRs",
        "detail": "Terrell is +3.8 on Flowers, but our WILL vs Andrews is -12.4, the worst matchup on the field. Bracket or double the TE and live with Bateman and Lane outside.",
        "conf": "read"
      }
    ],
    "attack": {
      "plan": "Stay run-first and aim it right. Lindstrom (+7.1) and Taylor (+5) win the right side, so duo and stretch go there, away from Madubuike on Bergeron (-5.8). Baltimore ranks 1st in coverage, so the passing game lives on play-action and the TE: Pitts vs Trenton Simpson (MCV 62) on boots and seams, short rhythm throws to London against Humphrey (+1.5). No shot plays at Wiggins (96 SPD) or into Hamilton's half unless PA pulls him down.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "player": "Trenton Simpson",
          "why": "WILL is the weakest cover player: MCV 62, ZCV 66, coverage gap 7.4 below unit. Pitts is +3 on him.",
          "how": "PA TE Seam and Y Stick from Wing Tight/Wing Pair, Pitts isolated on the WILL.",
          "conf": "read"
        },
