    "defend": {
      "plan": "Nickel base with contain rush and a spy on passing downs. Lamar (95 SPD, RUN 95) is the biggest problem: no edge crashes, Cover 1 Contain or QB Spy on third down, and user a linebacker on him when they go empty. Henry vs our 78.9 front is -7.6, so on early downs use the odd front with Dexter at nose and fit the run with a safety. The TE matchup is -12.4, so Andrews gets a bracket. Pressure Pocic (PBF 73) up the middle instead of off the edges, where Stanley is +10 on Ebukam.",
